            "**Judgement.** If justice means punishing everyone responsible, it was only partly achieved. But if justice also means establishing the truth and recognising victims, it went further — through the tribunal, museums like Tuol Sleng, and the 20 May Day of Remembrance. Overall, justice was real but limited and late.",
